ion></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/59NQXBWDK8JRIbD27yJlBaY5DeZozPREMIzYghtiblbXibCk9a8Rtgp9RggPEQBCMPa7S8FDtprMPbc6ibUJhFoAg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>06 参观院校</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>参观院图，触摸南雍文脉；漫步校园，感受南大魅力。</span><strong><span><span>（主要参观地点为文学院图书馆、南大校园等）</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/59NQXBWDK8JRIbD27yJlBaY5DeZozPREYgRLib3hMaNt67kM3lhU0ribxZbGzxSUO8clOFjLm0TnIictgicJSj3KFA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/59NQXBWDK8JRIbD27yJlBaY5DeZozPREPbVYEKToEHu5CoS7KEdF7iasDib1OKbRmaRsHUgUeE2kaGVYVD9XqJOQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、参与方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1. </span></span><strong><span><span>报名时间：</span></span></strong><span><span>即日起开始报名，报名截止时间为</span></span><strong><span><span>2025年6月23日中午12:00</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 打开下方链接填写报名信息，并</span></span><strong><span><span>上</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>传报名材料</span></span></strong><span><span>。如出现同一名学生多次提交报名的情况，根据时间以最新报名记录为准。</span></span><strong><span><span>报名网址：</span></span></strong><span><span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/rX15dgB.aspx</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 报名网址除需填写报名信息外，还需</span></span><strong><span><span>上传以下证明材料</span></span></strong><span><span>（所有材料按序合并成一个pdf文件上传，文件名</span></span><strong><span><span>命名规则：申请交流专业+本科学校+姓名</span></span></strong><span><span>，文件大小不超过10M）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）身份证（必传）：身份证正反面扫描至一页；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）学生证（必传）：学生信息页和报到注册页扫描成一页；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）外语能力证明材料（必传）：国家英语四级或六级考试、专业英语、TOEFL、GRE、GMAT或IELTS等成绩证明材料（至少提供其中一项）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）本科阶段成绩单（必传）：所在院校教务部门盖章的本科成绩单原件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）本科阶段专业排名证明（必传）：所在院校教务部门盖章的本科前三年（或前5学期）的总评成绩专业排名证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（6）其他材料（非必传）：</span></span></p><p><span><span>如有与申请交流专业相关的代表性学术成果、学术论文或学术著作，可作为其他材料上传。</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、讲座集邮</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>报名成功并线下参与的学员，可领取</span><strong><span><span>开放日文化衫</span></span></strong><span>一件与</span><span><strong><span>文院礼包</span></strong></span><span>（内含四个文件夹和八张明信片）一份。欢迎同学们踊跃参与，享受精神和文创的双重盛宴！</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/59NQXBWDK8JRIbD27yJlBaY5DeZozPREnDePa555v1veq2BuSHzcic5PW5XCNcZ2LHwZlZtnEeqk9mOx4