</section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/59NQXBWDK8JRIbD27yJlBaY5DeZozPRElabFDas9TCHnR7k9IMul29WOpSJy6IDaicxQkeicmiaMrric5376GD5RYA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/59NQXBWDK8JRIbD27yJlBaY5DeZozPREgjLfatbd9wF1l5ePs8oLbtk5nWCQ9tyiblTMTgc4jLImeicL76wP5cxw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/59NQXBWDK8JRIbD27yJlBaY5DeZozPREiayuianDFYAWmNPvDURxUsQlLdbdMz9DYUdXT3stQfTaJn2KiceYUeFzA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/59NQXBWDK8JRIbD27yJlBaY5DeZozPREPF5XoJo0MH3tgHQ4S4UUmXaSQh0qibHHAJnLFRY6aABhiaHy9SymUeug/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/59NQXBWDK8JRIbD27yJlBaY5DeZozPREMuFtsEu2RichRVzOvM3fq4bibnUXSPvu6xw5acws64D0l2CeFADI7C3w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>左右滑动，解锁全部文件夹、明信片样式</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、其他事宜</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.本次活动将组织专家于</span><span><span>2025年6月30日</span></span><span>前完成报名材料审核，确定入选人员。</span><strong><span><span>入选名单预计于6月30日以电子邮件或电话等形式通知申请者本人</span></span></strong><span>。因场地限制，本次开放日名额有限，未接到通知的同学也欢迎未来参与学院其他活动哦~</span></p><p><span>2.本次活动</span><strong><span><span>不收取任何费用</span></span></strong><span>。将提供入选人员两天的午餐，不提供住宿、往返交通及其他费用。</span></p><p><span>3.本次活动只包括学术讲座、参观交流等，</span><strong><span><span>无任何考核，不发放任何证书或开具任何证</span></span></strong><span>明。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/OUicWJdJoz3FTSibjoaMojKtbgciaJrT1kibHUtx6Veuz3eMwWeOGchLxibO7ibCiaxGEQfrKt1iaHGNQHDVMnYSlqqQUsCtdUPAoBiaC/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>文编：周琪儿</span></p><p><span>美编：赵睿</span></p><p><span>供图：周佳盈 季晴</span></p><p><span>责编：马晓娜 蒋馨怡 陈悦琪</span></p><p><span>审核:  童岭</span></p><p><span>终审：倪蛟 董晓</span></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/59NQXBWDK8JS0ZIs7xnS6l7bXH6ibicLiaIrRlkz1Ixc13xBX9brlsFDAUBib7YTj8NrKkXzbCnhqicMd8kLULKqhicA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/59NQXBWDK8JS0ZIs7xnS6l7bXH6ibicLiaIVib3HpnYswc3jgtMk2qQt5fflM6HK2dZ7nDQ1bHyN6SSibR9QQn1h8yA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8e1d4022cd992e003f97d4154a2c5587053ce64332a778d68363f0e528890140","textLength":2365,"sourceSha256":"363285f9b16dbf09ab21a2de5522a8123bc514d937ce7bccee68a5fadf67a6a6","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-721b3b9b745055c7bcff","title":"2025年南京大学文学院2025年本科生开放日活动报名公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:07.074886+00:00"}
